# Cursor Rules for morphir-dotnet

Start with [AGENTS.md](./AGENTS.md) as the primary guidance for this repository, and follow [CODING_STANDARDS.md](./CODING_STANDARDS.md) for all code changes and reviews.

## Progressive Disclosure

- **F# (`*.fs`, `*.fsi`, `*.fsx`, `*.fsproj`)**: [.agents/FSHARP_CODING_STANDARDS.md](./.agents/FSHARP_CODING_STANDARDS.md) (auto-triggered via `.cursor/rules/fsharp-coding-standards.mdc`)
- **C# (`*.cs`, `*.csproj`)**: [.agents/CSHARP_CODING_STANDARDS.md](./.agents/CSHARP_CODING_STANDARDS.md) (auto-triggered via `.cursor/rules/csharp-coding-standards.mdc`)
- **F#/C# boundary**: [.agents/skills/fsharp-csharp-interop/SKILL.md](./.agents/skills/fsharp-csharp-interop/SKILL.md), `.cursor/rules/fsharp-csharp-interop.mdc`, and subagent `fsharp-csharp-interop-reviewer` (`.claude/agents/`)
- **Tests**: [.agents/skills/test-manager/SKILL.md](./.agents/skills/test-manager/SKILL.md) and subagent `test-manager-reviewer` (`.claude/agents/`)
- **Specialized skills & guides**: [.agents/skills-reference.md](./.agents/skills-reference.md), [.agents/aot-optimization.md](./.agents/aot-optimization.md), [.agents/qa-testing.md](./.agents/qa-testing.md)
